section__
  @title "T268 - ACT4 - The Dreadfort Border Muster in crowded galleries"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/04-act4-iron-islands/frame-268.jpg"

  "Crowded galleries above Pyke's drill yard roar as Balon demands immediate commitment for a northern coastal strike tied to your Dreadfort intelligence. Yara counters that raiders sent without disciplined supply return as deserters with loot and no chain of command. Rumor already claims Valehart promised mutually exclusive targets to competing captains.

If you publish muster quotas and route assignments in open hearing, you may stop the rumor spiral and hold operational coherence. If you settle rival claims by threat and private reward, raids launch faster but every omitted captain becomes a future saboteur. The islands reward boldness, but they also punish inconsistency with spectacular betrayal.

The gallery boards tremble under boots while gulls scream over the surf below. Today is less about where your fleet sails than whether it sails under one authority."

  choice__
    @target "T269 - ACT4 - The Eyrie Crown Ultimatum by candle smoke"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Post muster quotas and target priorities in public view, sacrificing flexibility to restore coherent command structure"
  __choice

