section__
  @title "T269 - ACT4 - The Eyrie Crown Ultimatum by candle smoke"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/04-act4-iron-islands/frame-269.jpg"

  "On a coal-smoked dock chapel, salt priests read a written ultimatum from the Eyrie demanding safe passage for Vale merchants or formal reprisal against Ironborn raids. Yara sees opportunity in controlled piracy backed by deniable restitution. Balon sees weakness in any concession to mountain lords who cannot defend their own beaches.

Rations are already being allocated by perceived loyalty, and this dispute will harden those lines. Public arbitration could protect broader coalition legitimacy and keep supply math predictable. A covert hostage-and-ransom scheme could satisfy both sides temporarily while creating records that destroy you if exposed. In island politics, everyone claims to respect strength; most are really watching for inconsistency.

Charcoal flakes drift down like black snow as priests await your instruction. The policy you choose here will be repeated by captains who care only about precedent."

  choice__
    @target "T270 - ACT4 - Pentos Harbor Ambush in river fog"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
