section__
  @title "T276 - ACT4 - Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/04-act4-iron-islands/frame-276.jpg"

  "At the broken tower yard, three hostage lines face each other under spearpoint while Balon demands that Valehart surrender leverage first to prove trust. Yara counters that exchanges without simultaneous guarantees are invitations to treachery. The crowd of captains is loud, armed, and one spark from turning negotiation into massacre.

A public sequence with witnesses could keep this exchange enforceable and reduce cascading blood feuds. A covert preload of hidden archers and cutthroat contingencies might secure your side if betrayal comes, but if discovered before handover it confirms every claim that Valehart bargains in bad faith. Either way, the next tide carries word of how you handled Pyke.

Rainwater runs down cracked stones and pools around shackled ankles. You must choose between visible constraint and private insurance in full view of men who respect neither."

  choice__
